---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What Dangerous Robot keeps about you, who can read it, and how to remove it." layout="reading">
  <article class="reading">
    <Breadcrumb crumbs={[
      { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
      { label: 'Privacy' },
    ]} />
    <h1>Privacy</h1>

    <p class="lede">
      What we keep about you, who can read it, and how to remove it.
    </p>

    <h2>Reading the site</h2>
    <p>
      The site runs no analytics or tracking scripts. Display settings, such as theme and text size, are saved only in your browser.
    </p>

    <h2 id="petitions">Petitions</h2>
    <p>
      We use your email to confirm your signature, and to send occasional updates about the campaign only if you ask for them. We never show it or share it.
    </p>

    <h3>What we keep when you sign</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Your name.</li>
      <li>Your email address.</li>
      <li>Whether you want your name shown on the public list of signers.</li>
      <li>Whether you want email updates about the campaign.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Your IP address is used for a moment to slow down repeat attempts. It is not saved with your signature.
    </p>

    <h3>Who can read it</h3>
    <p>
      Only Dangerous Robot and the petition's authors. Cloudflare stores the list, Resend delivers the confirmation email, and updates are sent from a petition author's Gmail account, with every address hidden from the other recipients. The public list shows only the names of signers who chose to be listed.
    </p>

    <h3>How long we keep it</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>A signature that is never confirmed is deleted after 7 days.</li>
      <li>When a petition closes, we delete its signers' email addresses. Names and the count stay.</li>
      <li>If you confirmed your signature and asked for updates, we keep your email address after the petition closes, until you ask us to stop.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Stopping updates</h3>
    <p>
      To stop updates, reply to any update or write to <a href="mailto:contact@dangerousrobot.org">contact@dangerousrobot.org</a>. Your signature stays.
    </p>

    <h3>Removing your signature</h3>
    <p>
      Use the removal link in your confirmation email, or write to <a href="mailto:contact@dangerousrobot.org">contact@dangerousrobot.org</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .lede {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  article h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  article h3 {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
